                &lt;div&gt;
                    
                        &lt;article&gt;
                            &lt;h2&gt;&lt;a href="https://github.com/CommunityToolkit/Aspire/releases/tag/v13.4.0"&gt;v13.4.0&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
                            &lt;div&gt;
                                &lt;p&gt;This release aligns CommunityToolkit/Aspire with &lt;strong&gt;Aspire 13.4.0&lt;/strong&gt; and delivers new integrations, TypeScript AppHost improvements, CI reliability work, and broad package updates.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re especially excited to ship this alongside Aspire 13.4, where &lt;strong&gt;TypeScript AppHost is now GA&lt;/strong&gt;, resource commands gained typed arguments/process commands, and Kubernetes/AKS support continued to expand:&lt;br&gt;
&lt;a href="https://devblogs.microsoft.com/aspire/whats-new-aspire-13-4/" rel="nofollow"&gt;https://devblogs.microsoft.com/aspire/whats-new-aspire-13-4/&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;🔥 Highlights in this release&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;New integrations and capabilities&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Added &lt;strong&gt;DuckDB Aspire integration&lt;/strong&gt; (hosting + client) (&lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="4174114265" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/CommunityToolkit/Aspire/issues/1245" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/CommunityToolkit/Aspire/pull/1245/hovercard" href="https://github.com/CommunityToolkit/Aspire/pull/1245"&gt;#1245&lt;/a&gt;)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Added &lt;strong&gt;bacon hosting integration&lt;/strong&gt; (&lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="4415351426" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/CommunityToolkit/Aspire/issues/1302" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/CommunityToolkit/Aspire/pull/1302/hovercard" href="https://github.com/CommunityToolkit/Aspire/pull/1302"&gt;#1302&lt;/a&gt;)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Added &lt;strong&gt;Aspire integration analyzer&lt;/strong&gt; (&lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="4534429730" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/CommunityToolkit/Aspire/issues/1370" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/CommunityToolkit/Aspire/pull/1370/hovercard" href="https://github.com/CommunityToolkit/Aspire/pull/1370"&gt;#1370&lt;/a&gt;)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Added &lt;strong&gt;Bun package manager support&lt;/strong&gt; for JavaScript hosting extensions (&lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="4160457349" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/CommunityToolkit/Aspire/issues/1243" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/CommunityToolkit/Aspire/pull/1243/hovercard" href="https://github.com/CommunityToolkit/Aspire/pull/1243"&gt;#1243&lt;/a&gt;)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Added &lt;strong&gt;TypeScript AppHost skill and Ollama test&lt;/strong&gt; (&lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="4545080883" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/CommunityToolkit/Aspire/issues/1378" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/CommunityToolkit/Aspire/pull/1378/hovercard" href="https://github.com/CommunityToolkit/Aspire/pull/1378"&gt;#1378&lt;/a&gt;)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Added &lt;strong&gt;Aspire upgrade skill&lt;/strong&gt; support (&lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="4520194629" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/CommunityToolkit/Aspire/issues/1358" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/CommunityToolkit/Aspire/pull/1358/hovercard" href="https://github.com/CommunityToolkit/Aspire/pull/1358"&gt;#1358&lt;/a&gt;)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Reliability, fixes, and developer experience&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Swapped deprecated &lt;code&gt;flagd&lt;/code&gt; package (&lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="4240932720" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/CommunityToolkit/Aspire/issues/1272" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/CommunityToolkit/Aspire/pull/1272/hovercard" href="https://github.com/CommunityToolkit/Aspire/pull/1272"&gt;#1272&lt;/a&gt;)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fixed NuGet restore loop with CPM for SqlDatabaseProjects (&lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="4315302533" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/CommunityToolkit/Aspire/issues/1291" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/CommunityToolkit/Aspire/pull/1291/hovercard" href="https://github.com/CommunityToolkit/Aspire/pull/1291"&gt;#1291&lt;/a&gt;)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Aligned Sqlite enrich behavior (&lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="4258344523" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/CommunityToolkit/Aspire/issues/1282" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/CommunityToolkit/Aspire/pull/1282/hovercard" href="https://github.com/CommunityToolkit/Aspire/pull/1282"&gt;#1282&lt;/a&gt;)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Used &lt;code&gt;DatabaseName&lt;/code&gt; for Keycloak Postgres JDBC URL (&lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="4480091733" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/CommunityToolkit/Aspire/issues/1328" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/CommunityToolkit/Aspire/pull/1328/hovercard" href="https://github.com/CommunityToolkit/Aspire/pull/1328"&gt;#1328&lt;/a&gt;)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fixed waitfor behavior between script and runspace (&lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="4504850408" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/CommunityToolkit/Aspire/issues/1352" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/CommunityToolkit/Aspire/pull/1352/hovercard" href="https://github.com/CommunityToolkit/Aspire/pull/1352"&gt;#1352&lt;/a&gt;)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Simplified Aspire name resolution (&lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="4565666495" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/CommunityToolkit/Aspire/issues/1382" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/CommunityToolkit/Aspire/pull/1382/hovercard" href="https://github.com/CommunityToolkit/Aspire/pull/1382"&gt;#1382&lt;/a&gt;)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Improved affected test selection for TypeScript AppHost files (&lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="4545288995" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/CommunityToolkit/Aspire/issues/1379" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/CommunityToolkit/Aspire/pull/1379/hovercard" href="https://github.com/CommunityToolkit/Aspire/pull/1379"&gt;#1379&lt;/a&gt;)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Added transient Docker startup failure auto-rerun in CI (&lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="4520506470" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/CommunityToolkit/Aspire/issues/1360" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/CommunityToolkit/Aspire/pull/1360/hovercard" href="https://github.com/CommunityToolkit/Aspire/pull/1360"&gt;#1360&lt;/a&gt;)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Handled already-running job rerun 403s in transient auto-rerun workflow (&lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="4537718986" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/CommunityToolkit/Aspire/issues/1374" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/CommunityToolkit/Aspire/pull/1374/hovercard" href="https://github.com/CommunityToolkit/Aspire/pull/1374"&gt;#1374&lt;/a&gt;)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Improved PR test execution efficiency (&lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="4513967113" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/CommunityToolkit/Aspire/issues/1355" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/CommunityToolkit/Aspire/pull/1355/hovercard" href="https://github.com/CommunityToolkit/Aspire/pull/1355"&gt;#1355&lt;/a&gt;)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Versioning and dependency updates&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Updated to Aspire &lt;strong&gt;13.4.0&lt;/strong&gt; / preview train updates (&lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="4520472054" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/CommunityToolkit/Aspire/issues/1359" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/CommunityToolkit/Aspire/pull/1359/hovercard" href="https://github.com/CommunityToolkit/Aspire/pull/1359"&gt;#1359&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="4544607680" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/CommunityToolkit/Aspire/issues/1377" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/CommunityToolkit/Aspire/pull/1377/hovercard" href="https://github.com/CommunityToolkit/Aspire/pull/1377"&gt;#1377&lt;/a&gt;)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Updated workflows and tooling, including &lt;code&gt;actions/setup-dotnet&lt;/code&gt; v5 and &lt;code&gt;actions/github-script&lt;/code&gt; v9 (&lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="4533226733" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/CommunityToolkit/Aspire/issues/1363" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/CommunityToolkit/Aspire/pull/1363/hovercard" href="https://github.com/CommunityToolkit/Aspire/pull/1363"&gt;#1363&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="4254826206" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/CommunityToolkit/Aspire/issues/1279" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/CommunityToolkit/Aspire/pull/1279/hovercard" href="https://github.com/CommunityToolkit/Aspire/pull/1279"&gt;#1279&lt;/a&gt;)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Updated key dependencies including &lt;code&gt;coverlet.collector&lt;/code&gt;, &lt;code&gt;Microsoft.EntityFrameworkCore.Design&lt;/code&gt;, &lt;code&gt;Microsoft.Extensions.AI&lt;/code&gt;, DuckDB, and npm/yarn grouped updates (&lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="4423845134" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/CommunityToolkit/Aspire/issues/1306" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/CommunityToolkit/Aspire/pull/1306/hovercard" href="https://github.com/CommunityToolkit/Aspire/pull/1306"&gt;#1306&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="4489010367" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/CommunityToolkit/Aspire/issues/1331" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/CommunityToolkit/Aspire/pull/1331/hovercard" href="https://github.com/CommunityToolkit/Aspire/pull/1331"&gt;#1331&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="4533503490" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/CommunityToolkit/Aspire/issues/1368" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/CommunityToolkit/Aspire/pull/1368/hovercard" href="https://github.com/CommunityToolkit/Aspire/pull/1368"&gt;#1368&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="4533510300" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/CommunityToolkit/Aspire/issues/1369" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/CommunityToolkit/Aspire/pull/1369/hovercard" href="https://github.com/CommunityToolkit/Aspire/pull/1369"&gt;#1369&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="4533404644" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/CommunityToolkit/Aspire/issues/1365" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/CommunityToolkit/Aspire/pull/1365/hovercard" href="https://github.com/CommunityToolkit/Aspire/pull/1365"&gt;#1365&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="4537156603" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/CommunityToolkit/Aspire/issues/1373" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/CommunityToolkit/Aspire/pull/1373/hovercard" href="https://github.com/CommunityToolkit/Aspire/pull/1373"&gt;#1373&lt;/a&gt;)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Deprecations and obsoletions&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deprecated CommunityToolkit Bun hosting integration in favor of core &lt;code&gt;Aspire.Hosting.JavaScript&lt;/code&gt; (&lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="4538110016" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/CommunityToolkit/Aspire/issues/1376" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/CommunityToolkit/Aspire/pull/1376/hovercard" href="https://github.com/CommunityToolkit/Aspire/pull/1376"&gt;#1376&lt;/a&gt;)&lt;/li&gt;
